---
const proofs = [
  "Two-time YC founders",
  "Sold our last company to Gap Inc.",
  "Started Gap's office of AI",
];
---

<section id="credibility" class="relative py-20 md:py-28" aria-labelledby="credibility-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-8">
    <div class="ink-reveal yc-eyebrow">
      <img src="/yc-logo.svg" alt="Y Combinator" width="26" height="26" />
      <span>Backed by Y Combinator</span>
    </div>
    <h2
      id="credibility-heading"
      class="ink-reveal text-debossed text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground leading-[1.1] md:text-5xl max-w-3xl mt-5"
    >
      We've built AI inside a Fortune 500.
    </h2>

    <ul class="proofs">
      {proofs.map((p, i) => (
        <li class="proof ink-reveal" style={`--reveal-delay: ${200 + i * 90}`}>
          <span class="proof-mark" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><polyline points="4 12 10 18 20 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="proof-text">{p}</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <p
      class="ink-reveal mt-10 text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-2xl md:text-lg"
      style="--reveal-delay: 450"
    >
      Three years inside, from individual contributor to the C-suite. We know exactly where transformations go to die, which is why Marker builds instead of advises.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .yc-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }
  .yc-eyebrow img {
    display: block;
    width: 1.5rem;
    height: 1.5rem;
  }
  .yc-eyebrow span {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: #6b5638;
  }

  .proofs {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 2.75rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .proofs {
      margin-top: 3.5rem;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 0;
    }
  }

  .proof {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    padding: 0.25rem 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .proof {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 0 2rem;
      border-left: 1px solid #e0d6c4;
    }
    .proof:first-child {
      padding-left: 0;
      border-left: none;
    }
  }

  .proof-mark {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 1.85rem;
    height: 1.85rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #eaf2e5;
    border: 1px solid #c5dcb3;
    color: #3a7d56;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .proof-mark svg {
    width: 0.95rem;
    height: 0.95rem;
  }

  .proof-text {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #2d2418;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .proof-text {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
